        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, address",
          "value": "<p>[To:] His Excellency my master the elder Abu \u2019l-\u1e24asan \u2018All\u016bn the parnas b. Ya\u2018\u012bsh the Aaronide. May God protect his honored position. Fus\u1e6d\u0101\u1e6d, if God\u2014mighty and great\u2014wills.</p>\n<p>[From:] Ibrah\u012bm b. Khalaf b. N\u0101\u1e25\u016bm, who is grateful for your favors.</p>",
